<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-23T01:42:28.178Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:42:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed an NDC supporter in Enugu during a campaign attack and abducted pastor was found dead in Plateau, while bandits in Kaduna continue to hold a widow, her son and a newborn captive three weeks after kidnapping. Suspected herders attacked a Benue community, killing three and injuring others, and bandits ambushed a vehicle in Sokoto, killing a teacher and two others. Electricity workers withdrew services in Makurdi after an alleged attack, and Atiku urged a swift rescue of a kidnapped couple and infant in Kaduna. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPVXItNmFOcy1xTnAzMnJzNXpXQ193ZWZSWGp4U0tPVGd4Slc5aS02Zk5EYUtTbmJRemNqczhVdEdzTzYtQndLWEVHaUZjTHhZZFA5alFhZV9aX3NZdE1LcTBIb2huR1JWWnlPX3JGdDltZTAxODlGZ012T0doQmlZQlBoWFFIMTl1d3dVRElCQVNmMXpqeXRDRkNoZEEyaFJrZUlEWWFkUklXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPRFZ6Ym5SaFVYNWotUUJiVzdobmZubUdTVG16MlRUUXdhNHNNLXV3WWVhR1NYUkROaENMX21IUUlvRGRSdElZakkyNFRlVks0Z2ZEOE5teFFPc2ptT0xSM1h4dkhuOVBLWFNYbEkyeUk0ZEJLQkhpODRZbzhiWjVYYzhWYzhGVVIzTnNkdlBFTkVPcFZVWFY3R0ExcEpvNnk3SW9Sb0xJYTBHTFhhQzZnbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPUzBxMTN6Q1daSGdlb1N5a1htWW8xamJ5ZVQ1WVBBZGhxVlkwYWM0c3FLNWFPUUNGcmZfN2ZsVU52R1VEeHhqNWc0ZlgwWEdsaHhtbW5nVkE2QjZ5N3N2cTgxdlRzX2pWci1ENkdudEZNYjlWa0s2MW56NzgtLUFQRW5ILTdfTWs1MEVKaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Independent Newspaper Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNcVktdGV5N09GbUZ5M2ZNeVFOd09URmg5dHd1cjJ0LS13NDl1SGxFNi11ZWFxYlVTcm5DTUJsUVlmR3RhQWxtUjV4TWtVNXk4b1Y5eEtRNldnTlBxU0hXZzAwN09JVUFxd2V0eUtlZ1FBTDZWeXo1em9OMHRxaVA2RGZoTHQ2ZHE2V